@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<section class="hero-section">
    <div class="hero-glass text-start">
        <h1 class="hero-title mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>

        <p class="hero-subtitle">
            Your privacy is important to us. This Privacy Policy explains how
            Furniture &amp; Garden Design collects, uses, and protects your personal data.
        </p>

        <hr class="my-4" />

        <h4>1. Information We Collect</h4>
        <p>
            When you use our platform, we may collect the following information:
        </p>
        <ul>
            <li>Account information (email address, username)</li>
            <li>Order details such as dimensions, descriptions, and reference images</li>
            <li>Design preferences and interaction data within the application</li>
        </ul>

        <h4 class="mt-4">2. How We Use Your Information</h4>
        <p>
            The collected information is used exclusively to:
        </p>
        <ul>
            <li>Create and manage user accounts</li>
            <li>Process custom furniture and garden design requests</li>
            <li>Generate AI-powered design concepts based on your requirements</li>
            <li>Improve the quality and usability of the platform</li>
        </ul>

        <h4 class="mt-4">3. AI-Generated Designs</h4>
        <p>
            Uploaded reference images and provided descriptions may be used solely
            for the purpose of generating design concepts through AI-assisted tools.
            These materials are not shared with third parties and are processed only
            within the scope of the requested service.
        </p>

        <h4 class="mt-4">4. Data Storage and Security</h4>
        <p>
            We take reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect your
            personal data against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction.
            Access to sensitive data is restricted and secured.
        </p>

        <h4 class="mt-4">5. User Rights</h4>
        <p>
            In accordance with applicable data protection regulations, you have the right to:
        </p>
        <ul>
            <li>Access your personal data</li>
            <li>Request correction or deletion of your data</li>
            <li>Request restriction of processing</li>
            <li>Delete your account at any time</li>
        </ul>

        <h4 class="mt-4">6. Cookies</h4>
        <p>
            The application uses essential cookies required for authentication and
            secure operation. No tracking or advertising cookies are used.
        </p>

        <h4 class="mt-4">7. Changes to This Policy</h4>
        <p>
            This Privacy Policy may be updated periodically to reflect changes in
            functionality or legal requirements. Any updates will be published on this page.
        </p>

        <h4 class="mt-4">8. Contact</h4>
        <p>
            If you have any questions regarding this Privacy Policy or how your data is handled,
            please contact us through the application.
        </p>

        <p class="mt-5 text-muted">
            Last updated: January 2025
        </p>
    </div>
</section>
